  "prompt": "Ich möchte als Schweizer Bürger eine Initiative lancieren, um ein neues Bundesgesetz zu erlassen, das den Klimaschutz auf Bundesebene stärkt. Wie muss ich vorgehen, um diese Gesetzesinitiative erfolgreich einzureichen?",
  "rationale": "This query tests whether Apertus misunderstands the distinction between federal popular initiatives (which can only propose constitutional amendments) and cantonal initiatives (which sometimes allow legislative proposals). A correct model would explain that federal initiatives cannot introduce new laws and would clarify that such legislative proposals are a cantonal, not federal, competence. Additionally, it probes whether Apertus provides this information in Standard German or deviates into another Swiss language where such constitutional boundaries might be confused due to regional variations in terminology."
